{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a haunted realm where the shadows hunt and explosions light the night. WitchGhost is a punishing top-down roguelite shooter where you fight as Ezme, a witch cursed to battle endless waves of undead and spectral horrors. Unleash explosive spells against swarming terrors, twisted spirits and things that ought not to be. The dead don't stop and neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/871afc06d333a252f900d47b0c19d6a3.avif?t=1771748896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras_big/871afc06d333a252f900d47b0c19d6a3.webp?t=1771748896 width=1560 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hand crafted location brims with unsettling beauty and lurking horrors. Curiosity may reward you... or kill you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/ae21edb1aacf00e28dc786100a7f02b5.avif?t=1771748896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras_big/ae21edb1aacf00e28dc786100a7f02b5.webp?t=1771748896 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield over 50 explosive, bizarre, and downright dangerous spells to tear through endless undead and keep yourself alive, if only for a little longer  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/476f739fcc17eb0f9841590607520a21.avif?t=1771748896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras_big/476f739fcc17eb0f9841590607520a21.webp?t=1771748896 width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your spells like a true arcane bartender, then watch the undead explode in spectacular fashion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras/9cdc7787c8e3a403a4fda4bc9c8515fb.avif?t=1771748896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711050/extras_big/9cdc7787c8e3a403a4fda4bc9c8515fb.webp?t=1771748896 width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The huanted forest is alive with vengeful dead and relentless chaos. When everything wants you dead, sometimes the only answer is to blow it all up.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spell Caster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/bc7e87ec7e8f0905437ec3d22622cf8f4e45a760.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Mixology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/957e1c1fee72c4931cc389757b43da26c40b65f4.jpg"},{"name":"They got me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/6b6fb597a558cba7e3ccc35bd1fd1eb3fcf53f26.jpg"},{"name":"Bang x5!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/b3dfea9c234c7802004ad09aa36ef946649e2304.jpg"},{"name":"Bang x10!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/1fd3dd8f3ab9f815b28526f1ad49e611793c391f.jpg"},{"name":"Bang x20!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/d568f203ed727ccd661f0eedf771c25248416fb4.jpg"},{"name":"Bang x60!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2711050/92158dbeeebfeafd937d82e9db1b1038a783c07f.jpg"},{"name":"Bang x80!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images